Drop duplicate osVi stubs in stubs.c that collide with libultraship os_vi.cpp

`libultraship/libultra/os_vi.cpp` defines `osViSwapBuffer`, `osViSetMode`, `osViSetSpecialFeatures`,
`osViSetYScale`, `osViSetXScale`, `osViGetCurrentFramebuffer`, `osViGetNextFramebuffer`, and
`osViBlack` alongside `osCreateViManager` and `osViSetEvent`. `stubs.c` duplicates these eight
empty stubs, causing duplicate symbol errors when linking with `OOPS_CXX_LINK_OBJECTS = 1`.
Guard the duplicates in `stubs.c` so `os_vi.cpp`'s definitions win.
---
